PRIOR ART NOTICE
================================================================================

PoHI is published as prior art.

The intent of this project is to enable open research, standardization, and
interoperable implementations of cryptographically verifiable human intent
in AI-driven systems.

This repository and associated publications (including academic papers,
documentation, and reference implementations) define the original concept
and reference implementation of "Proof of Human Intent" (PoHI).

Any patents, if applicable, are intended to be used defensively and not to
restrict adoption, implementation, or standardization of this protocol.

================================================================================
ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

PoHI incorporates concepts and builds upon the following open standards
and technologies:

- World ID (World Foundation) - Zero-knowledge proof of personhood
- W3C Decentralized Identifiers (DIDs) - Decentralized identity standard
- W3C Verifiable Credentials (VCs) - Verifiable claims standard
- IETF SCITT - Supply Chain Integrity, Transparency, and Trust

We acknowledge and thank the communities developing these foundational
technologies.
